invariant: INV-16
file: p256_wide_field.c
catches: p256_equiv_test
reason: the second round of the Montgomery reduction is handed 0 where
  the first round's carry belongs, so a product whose first round carried
  out of its top word is short by 2^320 before the division.
  bin/p256_equiv_test holds every product to p256_field.c's on random and
  edge elements.

--- old
    high = reduce_round(t1, &t2, &t3, &t4, &t5, high);
--- new
    high = reduce_round(t1, &t2, &t3, &t4, &t5, 0);
